This file exists to satisfy Apache-2.0 section 4(d) for redistributors. The library
crates depend on `libm` alone (plus optional `mint`), each under its own licence;
the set is constrained by `deny.toml` and checked by `cargo deny check` (`just audit`).
Sophus, manif, GTSAM, sophus-rs and `tf_tree_math` are measurement oracles run from
`runners/` and `docker/oracles/`; none is linked into a library crate or a release artifact.
